<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-18T16:02:14.126Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian-backed militias in Iraq faced a mysterious explosion and a separate ammunition depot blast that injured five people, while an Iraqi investment firm was targeted in a Baghdad shooting and three foreign drug traffickers were arrested at sea. The Iraqi Prime Minister and the UK National Security Adviser reviewed security and economic ties, and Iraq’s foreign minister met Egypt’s FM to discuss parliamentary cooperation and an electricity interconnection project through Jordan. Iran and Iraq foreign ministers discussed regional security, including the Hormuz Strait, Palestine and Yemen conflicts, and the Kurdistan Regional Government warned that a coalition exit could enable an ISIS resurgence. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFA2Z0p0Z3N1bmMzbjdTRG1rSWNId205WC1ZY2hKUGprQVBPNWpiay1PazV1TkpDY0hhZWlZbEU1SFN1UlVEVEt3bGFod0dwQ3l1Mkw0YWczZjk3dFVs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOakh4cGRUajBRLW9WTW1hOGlYUUMyWU93amxhc3FQSjZUcS02RGEtUGNxR1ZWVG1FZjdkT3hKcW1XOFZGdUdmZXozNEczaEVscWFYRnF0VG5yWmFmNjN4WmhLcjU2Q2VVRFRubXZMV3RSRHJaZmhYZU1jV2RoVmVoY3laMEF0Q1l4d1c0WTJKMUl0c0NxT0xvUzZSYlNtSnBNdldCMHgxUWhORkxYS2Z2bHk4cmFMX0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQMjFtMkt2T1lnYWdUdlEtcThLWThPeEJwZ19QUDlQSWZaWmdnZ3c5MnRCMC1EbjZhVjVISEtkajZNVHVvTDM4d2stZkRETzNtZGRzR2ZlYzBLUy1ncTdaYnFIX2tjVlBpRUlqSVp0M0poT2IzbFBLb3NEMUlZWDNZZlozSmFLQlE2NVB3WjAtM0hlcUlKLUl5RG1UQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNLWpZUWdnSUV5UWY0MG4yMmVMVktobUVIbnFPSzgxalZuQ2tYdDJPVFJfa1V0SnlVbkFYS3VYYlhaTU9ZeFVKZDM1QTZWU1pGT2w4SU1